{"version":4,"text":"Training slide 17 was labelled 'Alder Relay 2.4: three attempts everywhere'. Editorial correction dated 2028-02-10: the slide copied the old 1.8 quickstart and was never approved as the 2.4 retry policy. Do not use it to determine 2.4 defaults or a cluster's effective value. Use the approved 2.4 normative policy together with the signed fleet configuration register.","id":"ar-training","title":"Unapproved Alder Relay training slide correction","source":"synthetic:alder/training-erratum","revision":4,"workspace_id":"0e75fb36-c33b-47dc-adbe-ae92434abba5"}